    "description": "The Loyalty History Retrieval API provides access to historical loyalty data for customers, allowing businesses to track and analyze loyalty points and engagement over time. This API enables users to fetch detailed information about loyalty transactions, enhancing their understanding of customer behavior and loyalty program effectiveness. Typical consumers include marketing teams, data analysts, and customer relationship management systems that aim to improve customer retention strategies. By leveraging this API, organizations can gain valuable insights into customer interactions with their loyalty programs.",
